        "TileImage": "$($repository 9c4cc4ef-3242-467a-9753-d998ad22a344).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned five High Value Targets (HVTs) at Club Holle in Berlin, Germany. Below are the targets as well as the preferred kill methods for them;\r\rEliminate Rolf Hirschmuller with a fall.\rEliminate Michail &quot;Mishoo&quot; Nenkov with a pistol headshot.\rEliminate Nicholas Velmorres with fiber wire. \rEliminate Gestur with a fall.\rEliminate Helfried Zeigler with injected lethal poison. \r\rLots of civilians, so please keep it clean. \r\rNow get on the dance floor and show them your moves!\rReapingZ",
